+  fpc-strictness gap). Per this lane's "no UI" approach, every Mem[] write below is
+  removed as pure display/SFX with no effect on game state (Battle/GroupEngage compute
+  Casualties/Killed/GroupsDestroyed independently of these draws) -- see each removal
+  site's own comment for specifics. }
+
+
